</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d7dbe3;border-radius:8px;padding:32px 24px;">

<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:'Familjen Grotesk',Onest,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;color:#12141c;">A webhook endpoint was disabled</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#12141c;">Prismaport disabled your Live mode webhook endpoint https://shop.example (we_01M5MY4JA0VHY826WNC5SSV6VN) on 31 Oct 2026 at 09:30 UTC: its deliveries had failed since 26 Oct 2026 at 18:04 UTC. The last attempt got: timeout.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#12141c;">It gets no deliveries until you enable it again in the dashboard. Events from the disabled period are not sent then; read them from the feed (GET /v1/events). The deliveries that were waiting can be resent from the log once the endpoint is enabled.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a href="https://pay.prismaport.test/dashboard/developers/webhooks/we_01M5MY4JA0VHY826WNC5SSV6VN?mode=live" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;background:#b0185a;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Open the endpoint</a></p>

